<style>  
.All_popupteam.modal { text-align: center; padding: 0 !important;}
.All_popupteam.modal:before {content: '';display: inline-block;height: 100%;vertical-align: middle;margin-right: -4px;}
.All_popupteam .modal-dialog {display: inline-block;text-align: left;vertical-align: middle;}


.All_popupteam .close{z-index: 1;position: absolute;right: 5px;font-size: 23px;background: #000;color: #fff;width: 30px;height: 30px;top: 5px;line-height: 30px;text-shadow: none;}
.team__box{ cursor:pointer}

.sn_ourppl .sn_titledesgn h4, .sn_mainhdn , .sn_membridentity h4{ color: #d29100}

.mtop{ margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:25px}
</style> 
    
    
 <!-- ----------------------ALL POPUP START HERE -------------------------------- -->
  <div id="Team1" class="modal fade All_popupteam" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
     <!-- Modal content-->
      <div class="modal-content">
          <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Kuldeep Singh</h4>
                              <small> Chief Product Officer</small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">Kuldeep holds a degree in Architecture from the School of Planning & Architecture and has delivered over 25 projects in real estate. With a strong focus on innovative design, he joined Tribeca as President, Architecture & Design. Before Tribeca, he worked with Raheja Developers and BPTP. At Tribeca, Kuldeep ensures every project embodies architectural excellence, reinforcing the brand’s vision of creating iconic developments.</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
    
    <div id="Team2" class="modal fade All_popupteam" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
     <!-- Modal content-->
      <div class="modal-content">
          <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Snehaal Kanade</h4>
                              <small> Design Head - West</small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">Snehaal, B. Arch, M. Arch, IGBC AP, with over a decade and a half of experience in architecture and design management, brings deep expertise in planning, coordination, and execution of large-scale real estate projects. A qualified architect, she has led multidisciplinary teams across luxury residential, commercial, and mixed-use developments, ensuring design excellence and functional precision. She has previously held senior roles in leading Indian real estate firms, where she drove innovative design strategies and seamless project delivery.<br>

At Tribeca, Snehaal oversees design development and planning, ensuring every project reflects the brand’s commitment to quality, aesthetics, and long-term value creation.</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
