  <div id="Team4" class="modal fade All_popupteam" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
     <!-- Modal content-->
      <div class="modal-content">
          <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Hetal Savla</h4>
                              <small> Head - Legal</small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">With a B.Com degree from Vartak College and an LLB from Mumbai University, Hetal Savla has 21 years of experience in legal advisory for real estate. She joined Tribeca in February 2025, bringing deep expertise in title diligence, contract negotiation, litigation strategy, and compliance frameworks. Prior to Tribeca, she led legal functions at Transcon Developers and Piramal Realty, and also worked extensively with Omkar Realtors. At Tribeca, Hetal oversees legal strategy, ensuring robust governance and risk management.</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="Team5" class="modal fade All_popupteam" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
     <!-- Modal content-->
      <div class="modal-content">
          <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Amit Goel</h4>
                              <small> Assistant Vice President - Finance</small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">Amit Goel is a Chartered Accountant and Cost Accountant with over two decades of experience in finance, audit, and strategic management. Before joining Tribeca, he held leadership roles at Glass Wall Systems, Gammon India, and Indiabulls Real Estate, where he oversaw finance, taxation, and capital management. Amit began his career with ICICI Bank and KPMG, specializing in Indian and US GAAP audits for listed entities. Known for his analytical rigour and governance focus, he now leads Tribeca’s financial strategy, ensuring fiscal discipline, transparency, and sustainable growth across all business verticals.</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="Team6" class="modal fade All_popupteam" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
     <!-- Modal content-->
      <div class="modal-content">
          <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Sachin Ahuja</h4>
                              <small>Head - CRM</small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">With over 19 years of experience in customer relations within real estate, Sachin heads CRM at Tribeca. His expertise lies in customer experience, retention, and process design. Before Tribeca, he worked with Emaar India and another leading developer, building strong systems for client satisfaction. A certified ISO auditor, Sachin ensures Tribeca’s homeowners experience world-class service and seamless post-purchase engagement.</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="Team7" class="modal fade All_popupteam" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
     <!-- Modal content-->
      <div class="modal-content">
          <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Kiran Shirsekar</h4>
                              <small>Head – Procurement & Contracts</small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">With a B.E. in Civil Engineering from Sardar Patel College of Engineering, an LLB from Government Law College Mumbai, and MRICS certification from the UK, Kiran Shirsekar brings 25 years of experience in procurement and contracts. He joined Tribeca in March 2024 and specializes in contracts administration, material procurement, dispute resolution, and cost optimization. Before Tribeca, Kiran held senior roles at The Wadhwa Group and Man Realty. He now leads procurement and contracts at Tribeca, ensuring value engineering and efficient project execution.</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="Team8" class="modal fade All_popupteam" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
     <!-- Modal content-->
      <div class="modal-content">
          <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Somendra Sarwal</h4>
                              <small>Head – Business Development</small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">Somendra holds a Post Graduate Diploma in Business Administration from NMIMS, Mumbai, and brings over two decades of experience across capital markets, investments, and real estate finance. He joined Tribeca as Head of Business Development & Investments, leading the company’s capital partnerships and strategic growth initiatives. Before Tribeca, he worked with JM Financial and Cushman & Wakefield in senior roles, raising and deploying significant capital across real estate asset classes. At Tribeca, Somendra drives investment strategy, fund relationships, and new business opportunities, ensuring sustained financial strength and expansion.</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="Team9" class="modal fade All_popupteam" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
     <!-- Modal content-->
      <div class="modal-content">
          <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Prateek Agarwal</h4>
                              <small> Strategy – Founder’s Office</small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">Prateek, PGDM – IIM Indore & B. Tech – NIT Raipur (Mech), with over nine years of experience across finance, strategy, and operations, serves as Executive Assistant to the Founder at Tribeca Developers. He has previously worked with Asian Paints and Mahindra Group, where he led financial transformation projects, budgeting, analytics, and digital initiatives across automotive and manufacturing sectors. Beginning his career with Tata Motors, Prateek built a strong foundation in process excellence and quality management. A versatile professional with cross-functional expertise, he now partners closely with Tribeca’s leadership on strategic initiatives, business planning, and organizational growth.</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="Team10" class="modal fade All_popupteam" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
     <!-- Modal content-->
      <div class="modal-content">
          <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Bhavesh Gada</h4>
                              <small> Strategy Founder’s Office </small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">A Chartered Accountant, Company Secretary, and Law graduate with a B.Com degree, Bhavesh brings over 15 years of experience in finance and strategic management. He joined Tribeca in 2025 as Head of Strategy, overseeing financial planning, valuations, and organizational strategy.
His expertise spans deal and asset management, investor relations, and stakeholder communication. Before Tribeca, he served as Chief Investment Officer at Avas Living LLP and Vice President – Finance and Investor Relations at Phoenix Mills Limited.
At Tribeca, Bhavesh drives strategic decision-making and financial discipline, ensuring sustained growth and long-term value creation.

</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
    
    
    
    
