        <div class="modal-body">
         <div class="sn_membridentity">
                              <h4>Rajan Mahajan</h4>
                              <small>Head – Construction</small>
                            </div>
                            
                            <hr>
                            <div class="desi-text">With a degree in Civil Engineering from ShJP Polytechnic and Engineering College, Mumbai, and postgraduate qualifications in Business Management and Advanced Project Management from the Welingkar Institute of Management, Rajan Mahajan brings over 29 years of experience in real estate project execution and construction management. Before joining Tribeca Developers in May 2024, he served as General Manager – Projects at Kalpataru Ltd. for 22 years and worked with Lok Housing and Construction Ltd. for a decade. At Tribeca, Rajan oversees end-to-end project delivery, ensuring quality, precision, and timely execution.</div>
        </div>
         
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
    
